WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.566
- So you just became a
mom, congratulations.

00:00:01.566 --> 00:00:02.399
- I did.

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:03.512
- You don't look like
you just became a mom.

00:00:03.512 --> 00:00:04.345
Well done.
- Thank you.

00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:05.178
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah. (chuckles)

00:00:05.178 --> 00:00:06.040
- It's been four weeks.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.770
He's like four weeks and a day today.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:08.690
- [Kelly] Wow.
- Yeah.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.990
- Oh my God, are you tired?

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.900
- I'm a little, no, I'm
so happy to be here.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.733
Are you kidding me? Like I'm so-

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:14.550
- [Kelly] You wanted to
say I'm tired. (laughs)

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.790
- I'm a little bit tired here and there,

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:16.762
but I find times to nap,
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:19.622
- And he's such a good little
baby and I'm so in love.

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:20.850
I mean, you're a mom.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.683
- [Kelly] Awww. Yes.

00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:24.340
- It's the greatest, it's my
greatest job I'll ever have.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.430
- One hun- and it will
be, I know it's so cliche

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.004
but it will be the hardest, because you,

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:30.740
the hardest thing for me is
when they're so freaking cute

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:31.573
and you love them so much

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.100
but they're doing
something that's naughty.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:33.933
- Right.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.870
- And you're like, "Nope."
- [Katharine] Whoa.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.300
- You will not twist
me around your finger.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.133
- Someone told me that.

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.430
My girlfriend who was doing my hair today,

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.770
she was like, "Oh, can you even imagine

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:40.870
that you're gonna have to
get mad at him one day?"

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.709
I'm like, "No, he's so sweet
right now. I can't imagine."

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:46.547
- Trust me, it'll happen,
it'll happen, and you'll go,

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:47.610
"Whose child are you?"
(both laugh)

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.743
- [Katharine] Exactly, yeah.

